title: Zolto Spatial Layout & Canvas Engine Showcase (Phase 8)
author: Zolto Core Team
date: 2026-07-26
---

# Zolto Phase 8 — Spatial Layout Showcase

This document demonstrates the declarative spatial layout systems introduced in Phase 8:

1. Top-Level Layout (`@layout`)
2. CSS Grid System (`@grid` & `@cell`)
3. Flexbox & Layer Stack (`@flex`, `@item`, `@stack`)
4. Canvas & Absolute Positioning (`@canvas`, `@layer`)
5. Multi-Page & Print Layout (`@pages`, `@page`)
6. Slide Presentation Deck (`@presentation`, `@slide`)

---

## 1. Top-Level Layout & CSS Grid

@layout width=100% padding=24 gap=20 theme="dark"
  @header
    # Executive Dashboard 2026
  @/header

  @grid columns=12 gap=16
    @cell span=8
      @flex direction="column" gap=12
        @item
          ### Sales Performance
          @chart bar title="Monthly Sales" theme="dark"
          labels: Jan Feb Mar Apr May Jun
          data: 450 620 580 810 950 1100
          @/chart
        @/item
      @/flex
    @/cell

    @cell span=4
      @flex direction="column" gap=12
        @item
          @card title="Active Sessions" variant="info"
            14,892 Concurrent Users
          @/card
        @/item
        @item
          @card title="System Health" variant="success"
            99.99% Uptime
          @/card
        @/item
      @/flex
    @/cell
  @/grid

  @footer
    Generated by Zolto Spatial Layout Engine
  @/footer
@/layout

---

## 2. Canvas & Absolute Positioning

@canvas width=800 height=300 snap=10 guides=true
  @layer id="background" z=0
    @rect x=0 y=0 w=800 h=300 radius=16 fill="#0f1117"
    @/rect
  @/layer

  @layer id="foreground" z=10
    @text x=40 y=60 size=28 weight=700 fill="#ffffff"
      Absolute Canvas Positioning
    @/text

    @image x=40 y=100 w=240 h=140 src="hero.png"
    @/image
  @/layer
@/canvas

---

## 3. Slide Presentation Deck

@presentation theme="dark" ratio="16:9"
  @slide type="title"
    # Zolto Phase 8
    ### Spatial Layout & Presentation Engine
  @/slide

  @slide type="content"
    ## Key Pillars
    - Responsive CSS Grid & Flexbox
    - Absolute Canvas Positioning
    - Multi-Page Print Publications
    - Interactive Slide Decks
  @/slide
@/presentation
